{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":8,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":345,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1881807,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281603,"Name":"NMungarro","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1420402133,"LastPoster":{"Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1881807,"PostDate":1420402133,"PostContent":"Hello! I'm a newbie planning our wedding at the Moon Palace Resort in June of 2015. \u00a0We have been...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nmungarro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.183.125.177","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420399770,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NMungarro","Id":281603,"Name":"NMungarro","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.183.125.177","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78539,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a334d1f56c62701ac620c31d9ccbad41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello! I&#039;m a newbie planning our wedding at the Moon Palace Resort in June of 2015. &amp;nbsp;We have been engaged since July and can&#039;t wait for our destination wedding. &amp;nbsp;We anticipate having 50-75 guests and plan on having group activities our guests can enjoy. I have already begun to plan our wedding am in the process of deciding on DJ, photographer, decor, flowers, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone used the in-house vendors?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have any recommendations for outside vendors? Is it worth the fee?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any sort of tips, experiences or thoughts would be greatly appreciated :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881807,"PostDate":1420402133,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello! I'm a newbie planning our wedding at the Moon Palace Resort in June of 2015. \u00a0We have been engaged since July and can't wait for our destination wedding. \u00a0We anticipate having 50-75 guests and plan on having group activities our guests can enjoy. I have already begun to plan our wedding am in the process of deciding on DJ, photographer, decor, flowers, etc.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone used the in-house vendors?<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone have any recommendations for outside vendors? Is it worth the fee?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any sort of tips, experiences or thoughts would be greatly appreciated <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nmungarro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.183.125.177","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420399770,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NMungarro","Id":281603,"Name":"NMungarro","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78539,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d7d29bd19d13422625b7c650f15af76","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome! Moon Palace is a very popular resort with the ladies here so there is no shortage of information that should help you on your planning adventure! I hope you have a good travel agent helping you out as that will be important over the coming months. Here are links to two of the discussion forums that will give you a start. Definitely spend some time reading through as there is a lot of content.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71504-moon-palace-2014\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71504-moon-palace-2014\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881808,"PostDate":1420403311,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome! Moon Palace is a very popular resort with the ladies here so there is no shortage of information that should help you on your planning adventure! I hope you have a good travel agent helping you out as that will be important over the coming months. Here are links to two of the discussion forums that will give you a start. Definitely spend some time reading through as there is a lot of content.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71504-moon-palace-2014\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...on-palace-2014\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...-palace-brides\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283430199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1393821808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78539,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1420485770,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"559eb535b15f62d2115be7f1140b09a6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"NMungarro\"] welcome to the forum and congrats on your engagement and 2015 wedding! I&#039;m also getting married at Moon Palace so I can try to help you out but I&#039;ve never been there and my wedding is later than yours, it&#039;s actually in 2016. Any questions you may have, feel free to ask.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nEven though my wedding is still a year away, I&#039;ve booked a few vendors already. For hair and makeup, I&#039;ve booked Styling Trio.nthey have great reviews and is an onsite vendor. For photography I went with an outside vendor, Samuel Luna. I love his photography style and with the outside vendor fee, he was still cheaper than the in-house palace photographer. For decor Palace has three in-house vendors and I went with LatinAsia. They are so nice and easy to communicate with. They have a great vision and works with your budget. I&#039;m still looking into a DJ but have heard that DJ Discomovil has a great rate and is worth it even after the vendor fee. Hope that helps a bit.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881811,"PostDate":1420404898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281603-nmungarro\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NMungarro<\/span><\/a> welcome to the forum and congrats on your engagement and 2015 wedding! I'm also getting married at Moon Palace so I can try to help you out but I've never been there and my wedding is later than yours, it's actually in 2016. Any questions you may have, feel free to ask.\u00a0<br><br>\nEven though my wedding is still a year away, I've booked a few vendors already. For hair and makeup, I've booked Styling Trio.nthey have great reviews and is an onsite vendor. For photography I went with an outside vendor, Samuel Luna. I love his photography style and with the outside vendor fee, he was still cheaper than the in-house palace photographer. For decor Palace has three in-house vendors and I went with LatinAsia. They are so nice and easy to communicate with. They have a great vision and works with your budget. I'm still looking into a DJ but have heard that DJ Discomovil has a great rate and is worth it even after the vendor fee. Hope that helps a bit.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410069785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78539,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b4c565ed309bcd4f63215692c7003d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to BDW! &amp;nbsp;Moon Palace is a fabulous place to get married. &amp;nbsp;Do you know what resort you will stay at?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are a Platinum PRO agency with Palace resorts which is their highest level. &amp;nbsp;We can def. help answer some of your questions.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881923,"PostDate":1420485215,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to BDW! \u00a0Moon Palace is a fabulous place to get married. \u00a0Do you know what resort you will stay at?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are a Platinum PRO agency with Palace resorts which is their highest level. \u00a0We can def. help answer some of your questions.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com<\/span><br>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/75243-karisma-diamond-level-5\/\" title=\"Karisma Diamond Level 5\"><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_8442\/sml_gallery_206696_8442_4984.png' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Karisma Diamond Level 5'  width='200' height='200'  alt='Karisma Diamond Level 5' id='sml_image_view_75243' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/77453-pro-palace-specialist-agent-platinum-sm\/\" title=\"PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm\"><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_2474.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm'  width='200' height='118'  alt='PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm' id='sml_image_view_77453' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137195420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.152.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78539,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f58b8b34c969d7ec8abcaf11b1d1d543","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, NMungarro, and COngrats on your upcoming Moon Palace wedding!!! you&#039;re off to a great start by joining the forum with all its&#039; resources to help with your planning decisions - so well done :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also you&#039;ve chosen a beautiful venue for your wedding celebration - as you can see in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at one of his recent weddings there....with more at the album link here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/901362_10151930922849487_1996511889_o.jpg\" alt=\"901362_10151930922849487_1996511889_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1412812_10151930923244487_505331647_o.jpg\" alt=\"1412812_10151930923244487_505331647_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1401724_10151930925634487_219052324_o.jpg\" alt=\"1401724_10151930925634487_219052324_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881968,"PostDate":1420529067,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, NMungarro, and COngrats on your upcoming Moon Palace wedding!!! you're off to a great start by joining the forum with all its' resources to help with your planning decisions - so well done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also you've chosen a beautiful venue for your wedding celebration - as you can see in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at one of his recent weddings there....with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding Album<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/901362_10151930922849487_1996511889_o.jpg\" alt=\"901362_10151930922849487_1996511889_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1412812_10151930923244487_505331647_o.jpg\" alt=\"1412812_10151930923244487_505331647_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1401724_10151930925634487_219052324_o.jpg\" alt=\"1401724_10151930925634487_219052324_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.185.214.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78539,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d0bcccd14a11694e32dce879fb351c6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Dear NMungarro,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congratulations on your wedding and for choosong to have a DW. The Riviera Maya is such a stunning area to have a wedding and the Moon Palace is lovely.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on joining the forum too,you absolutely cannot go wrong for information here and there is an answer for you.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;We would like to invite you to read our article \"Top Tips for WOW beach wedding Photos\" you can find it on the home page of the forum or by using the below link.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/wedding-tips\/top-tips-for-wow-beach-wedding-photos-by-vincen-r2226\" title=\"\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdesti...by-vincen-r2226&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Also a couple of photos to set your imagination in moption...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17791\/sml_gallery_277385_17791_252414.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17791_252414.jpg\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17791\/sml_gallery_277385_17791_344857.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17791_344857.jpg\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17791\/sml_gallery_277385_17791_108637.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17791_108637.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Let me know if you have any questions&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Happy Planning&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Alexis&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884219,"PostDate":1422285386,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Dear NMungarro,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations on your wedding and for choosong to have a DW. The Riviera Maya is such a stunning area to have a wedding and the Moon Palace is lovely.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on joining the forum too,you absolutely cannot go wrong for information here and there is an answer for you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">We would like to invite you to read our article \"Top Tips for WOW beach wedding Photos\" you can find it on the home page of the forum or by using the below link.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/wedding-tips\/top-tips-for-wow-beach-wedding-photos-by-vincen-r2226' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...by-vincen-r2226<\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Also a couple of photos to set your imagination in moption...<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17791\/sml_gallery_277385_17791_252414.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17791_252414.jpg\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17791\/sml_gallery_277385_17791_344857.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17791_344857.jpg\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17791\/sml_gallery_277385_17791_108637.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17791_108637.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Let me know if you have any questions<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Happy Planning<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Alexis<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#696969;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Please <strong>click<\/strong> on the 5 thumbnail images below to view more info on each topic.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com\/portfolio-1-weddings'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01weddings-and-great-moments-pixan.jpg\" alt=\"01weddings-and-great-moments-pixan.jpg\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com\/portfolio-7-trash-the-dress'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/amazing-trash-the-dress-pixan-photography.jpg\" alt=\"amazing-trash-the-dress-pixan-photograph\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01pixan-photography-logo-bdwf.jpg\" alt=\"01pixan-photography-logo-bdwf.jpg\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/mad.ly\/cabe64'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01download-our-wedding-welcome-guide-pixan.jpg\" alt=\"01download-our-wedding-welcome-guide-pix\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/mad.ly\/3112b4'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01pixan-riviera-maya-honeymoon-photo-adventure.jpg\" alt=\"01pixan-riviera-maya-honeymoon-photo-adv\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pixanphoto'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pixanphotograph\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Pinterest.png\" alt=\"Pinterest.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/vimeo.com\/pixanphotography'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Vimeo.png\" alt=\"Vimeo.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/plus.google.com\/u\/0\/102756607804404106269\/posts'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Google+.png\" alt=\"Google+.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/skype'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Skype.png\" alt=\"Skype.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/pixan-photography'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/LinkedIn.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Wordpress.png\" alt=\"Wordpress.png\"><\/a>\u00a0<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Public Relations<\/strong> |<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#66cccc;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Pixan Photography<\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:#add8e6;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\">|<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:georgina@pixanphoto.com'><span style=\"color:#a9a9a9;\">georgina<\/span><\/a><\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:georgina@pixanphoto.com'><span style=\"color:#a9a9a9;\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\">@pixanphoto.com<\/span><\/span><\/a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\">|<strong> <\/strong><\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com'><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(245,177,71);\">www.pixanphoto.com<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"georgina@pixanphoto.com","IpAddress":"201.166.29.36","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1398703002,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277766.jpg?_r=1411686578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PixanPhotography","Id":277766,"Name":"PixanPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78539,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87266d1a4b3ecfd9e2b7e0956646300d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi, and Welcome to the forum!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Moon Palace is an awesome choice with something for everyone! Please let us know if you have any questions or we here on the forum and from Wright Travel can be of help to you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884224,"PostDate":1422288910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi, and Welcome to the forum!<\/p>\n<p>Moon Palace is an awesome choice with something for everyone! Please let us know if you have any questions or we here on the forum and from Wright Travel can be of help to you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238005440,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78539,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c745bf07648a66245816a15bf68d0c10","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@NMungarro   Congrats on picking a resort!&amp;nbsp; We actually get married the same week as you there!&amp;nbsp; We will be getting married two days before you on Tuesday 23rd at Toucan Gazebo.    Maybe we will get to run into one another while there!\t Moon Palace is a beautiful resort.   For us we are pretty much bringing all our own d\u00e9cor except we are going to rent some lighting and sound system.&amp;nbsp; For the sound system so far we got a better quote through PSAV.&amp;nbsp; For d\u00e9cor I would say contact all three vendors,&amp;nbsp; give them your ideas and see what they have to offer.&amp;nbsp; Also don&#039;t forget to ask the vendors their setup, delivery fees, etc. &amp;nbsp;We want either lights wrapped around palms or tiki torches, but not all of the vendors offer it.   Your wedding is Thursday right? &amp;nbsp;- the nightclub on site is only open certain nights of the week.&amp;nbsp; Its open Tues, Thurs, Fri and Sat 10p-3 or 5am.&amp;nbsp; One thing we are doing is instead of paying for extra hours to have our reception keep going we are going to invite our party to join us at Nior after since its open.&amp;nbsp; Just a suggestion since yours is on one of the nights its open.&amp;nbsp; Who is your coordinator that you are working with?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885639,"PostDate":1423388249,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@NMungarro\u00a0\u00a0 Congrats on picking a resort!\u00a0 We actually get married the same week as you there!\u00a0 We will be getting married two days before you on Tuesday 23rd at Toucan Gazebo. \u00a0\u00a0 Maybe we will get to run into one another while there!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Moon Palace is a beautiful resort.\u00a0\u00a0 For us we are pretty much bringing all our own d\u00e9cor except we are going to rent some lighting and sound system.\u00a0 For the sound system so far we got a better quote through PSAV.\u00a0 For d\u00e9cor I would say contact all three vendors,\u00a0 give them your ideas and see what they have to offer.\u00a0 Also don't forget to ask the vendors their setup, delivery fees, etc. \u00a0We want either lights wrapped around palms or tiki torches, but not all of the vendors offer it.\u00a0\u00a0 Your wedding is Thursday right? \u00a0- the nightclub on site is only open certain nights of the week.\u00a0 Its open Tues, Thurs, Fri and Sat 10p-3 or 5am.\u00a0 One thing we are doing is instead of paying for extra hours to have our reception keep going we are going to invite our party to join us at Nior after since its open.\u00a0 Just a suggestion since yours is on one of the nights its open.\u00a0 Who is your coordinator that you are working with?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishtb96@aol.com","IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383024467,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misbosox","Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"78539","Title":"Newbie Bride June 2015 Wedding Moon Palace Resort","LastPostDate":1423388249},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
