ustom"},"FormattedName":"b2b2011","Id":226893,"Name":"b2b2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38741,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"997c0792beac7a4067c8e598d22dcfad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi there,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am a travel agent based in Canada who has stayed at this resort and arranged weddings here too, if you like I can chat to you about this 866 678 9335 is my local number, I am just arranging a wedding of 25 for GSRM for Jan 2011, its a stunning resort. Angela&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1248066,"PostDate":1281375035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi there,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am a travel agent based in Canada who has stayed at this resort and arranged weddings here too, if you like I can chat to you about this 866 678 9335 is my local number, I am just arranging a wedding of 25 for GSRM for Jan 2011, its a stunning resort. Angela<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela@advantagetravelworld.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281374851,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231194.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngelaMowbray","Id":231194,"Name":"AngelaMowbray","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38741,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2bb68b0ba6fa88d6abcab17791d7b185","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; HI there,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am a travel agent based in Canada who has arranged many weddings in Mexico and GSRM is a popular resort, its so beautiful, I have stayed here myself and can say this is a great choice, I can help you if you like, you can reach me at 866 678 9335, Angela&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1248067,"PostDate":1281375121,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> HI there,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am a travel agent based in Canada who has arranged many weddings in Mexico and GSRM is a popular resort, its so beautiful, I have stayed here myself and can say this is a great choice, I can help you if you like, you can reach me at 866 678 9335, Angela<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela@advantagetravelworld.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281374851,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231194.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngelaMowbray","Id":231194,"Name":"AngelaMowbray","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38741,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96311b3805ed00a24fef88dee27ea83c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi b2b2011&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We booked the Transat wedding package, they have $500 &amp;amp; $1000 pricing for wedding packages, and its pretty much the same choices as if you booked through the resort, if you want to see the powerpoint presentation the resort wedding planner gave me, send me a private message with your email address&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1249452,"PostDate":1281459974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi b2b2011<\/p> <p> We booked the Transat wedding package, they have $500 & $1000 pricing for wedding packages, and its pretty much the same choices as if you booked through the resort, if you want to see the powerpoint presentation the resort wedding planner gave me, send me a private message with your email address<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kileelaine@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1269454294,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226748.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kileelaine","Id":226748,"Name":"kileelaine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38741,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f8d8498a83efbf6dcbac37d5b832e0f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey there,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Did you go with this resort for your wedding?&amp;nbsp; We are considering it but I am having troubles finding anything online in regards to weddings there it does sound lovely tho from what the TA has said.&amp;nbsp; I am not totally keen on having a beach ceremony just because of gawkers so I am just wondering how private it was or if there are other locations to have the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; Also were you able to have a mini reception with first dance ect?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Denita&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1273159,"PostDate":1283236483,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey there,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Did you go with this resort for your wedding?\u00a0 We are considering it but I am having troubles finding anything online in regards to weddings there it does sound lovely tho from what the TA has said.\u00a0 I am not totally keen on having a beach ceremony just because of gawkers so I am just wondering how private it was or if there are other locations to have the ceremony.\u00a0 Also were you able to have a mini reception with first dance ect?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks<\/p> <p> Denita<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nickeld@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1264619199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225110.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"denita","Id":225110,"Name":"denita","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38741,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8da04a9fed903b867d436ad73d09e2f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Did the wedding coordinator at the Grand Sirenis change? I was dealing with Tania and now someone else emailed me and now no one has responded in over a week and a half.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1275133,"PostDate":1283336169,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Did the wedding coordinator at the Grand Sirenis change? I was dealing with Tania and now someone else emailed me and now no one has responded in over a week and a half.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Christie_C_Guimont@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1264603563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225104.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChristieG","Id":225104,"Name":"ChristieG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38741,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b1a486445322de4747a6b03ab31fe4a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am&amp;nbsp;getting married at Grand Sirenis Mayan Beach&amp;nbsp;in January 2011,&amp;nbsp;havent talked to the wedding coordinator yet, just relying on my TA so far. Would love any pictures or input anyone has...Going with the Transat Holiday package...hopefully it works out&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1275142,"PostDate":1283336473,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am\u00a0getting married at Grand Sirenis Mayan Beach\u00a0in January 2011,\u00a0havent talked to the wedding coordinator yet, just relying on my TA so far. Would love any pictures or input anyone has...Going with the Transat Holiday package...hopefully it works out\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandaholle@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1283334188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231954.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amandasalways","Id":231954,"Name":"amandasalways","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38741,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b74363eefb360313d8e975974e6ff44c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey ChristieG -- yes, the coordinator has changed. My MIL just called me today to say that Tania left (not sure why). Supposedly the new person is still using the same email address, though?! Weird...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1279647,"PostDate":1283788893,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey ChristieG -- yes, the coordinator has changed. My MIL just called me today to say that Tania left (not sure why). Supposedly the new person is still using the same email address, though?! Weird...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melaina_h@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.66.20.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1263257273,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Melaina","Id":224574,"Name":"Melaina","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38741,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18df11b54bfe0d5d1998e9ad8e5c47f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; amandasalways&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have pics sent to me by a previous Grand Sirenis bride, as well as a presentation from the resort, send me a personal message with your email address and I will send them to you&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1280809,"PostDate":1283879666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> amandasalways<\/p> <p> I have pics sent to me by a previous Grand Sirenis bride, as well as a presentation from the resort, send me a personal message with your email address and I will send them to you<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kileelaine@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1269454294,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226748.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kileelaine","Id":226748,"Name":"kileelaine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38741,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39f88c5a03176e26dd1301c05001b1fa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello I am very interested in seeing the Power Point presentation as my daughter is&amp;nbsp;getting married in November 2011 at\n Grand Sirenis and we too have booked the&amp;nbsp;Air Transat package but want to have some&amp;nbsp;extras added.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Would appreciate any information that you have.&amp;nbsp; My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:linda.reavley@bchydro.com\"&gt;linda.reavley@bchydro.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1337111,"PostDate":1289474599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello I am very interested in seeing the Power Point presentation as my daughter is\u00a0getting married in November 2011 at<br \/> Grand Sirenis and we too have booked the\u00a0Air Transat package but want to have some\u00a0extras added.\u00a0 \u00a0Would appreciate any information that you have.\u00a0 My email is <a href='mailto:linda.reavley@bchydro.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>linda.reavley@bchydro.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lreavley@bchydro.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1289473961,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233872.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lreavley","Id":233872,"Name":"lreavley","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1309,"TotalPages":131,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":1300},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
